": " un", "s": 29.04, "e": 29.34}, {"w": " pain", "s": 29.34, "e": 29.72}, {"w": " baguette,", "s": 29.72, "e": 30.28}, {"w": " des", "s": 30.38, "e": 30.56}, {"w": " pickles,", "s": 30.56, "e": 31.0}, {"w": " oignons,", "s": 31.22, "e": 31.62}, {"w": " des", "s": 31.76, "e": 31.88}, {"w": " frites.", "s": 31.88, "e": 32.1}]}, {"start": 32.18, "end": 34.96, "text": " On a adoré ce sandwich, l'un des meilleurs que j'ai goûté en vrai dans ma vie.", "words": [{"w": " On", "s": 32.18, "e": 32.3}, {"w": " a", "s": 32.3, "e": 32.38}, {"w": " adoré", "s": 32.38, "e": 32.56}, {"w": " ce", "s": 32.56, "e": 32.68}, {"w": " sandwich,", "s": 32.68, "e": 33.02}, {"w": " l", "s": 33.18, "e": 33.24}, {"w": "'un", "s": 33.24, "e": 33.32}, {"w": " des", "s": 33.32, "e": 33.46}, {"w": " meilleurs", "s": 33.46, "e": 33.96}, {"w": " que", "s": 33.96, "e": 34.18}, {"w": " j", "s": 34.18, "e": 34.28}, {"w": "'ai", "s": 34.28, "e": 34.32}, {"w": " goûté", "s": 34.32, "e": 34.56}, {"w": " en", "s": 34.56, "e": 34.72}, {"w": " vrai", "s": 34.72, "e": 34.72}, {"w": " dans", "s": 34.72, "e": 34.84}, {"w": " ma", "s": 34.84, "e": 34.92}, {"w": " vie.", "s": 34.92, "e": 34.96}]}, {"start": 35.06, "end": 39.16, "text": " On a pris aussi du poulet pané frit, très bonne chapeur, ils étaient énormes.", "words": [{"w": " On", "s": 35.06, "e": 35.14}, {"w": " a", "s": 35.14, "e": 35.32}, {"w": " pris", "s": 35.32, "e": 35.44}, {"w": " aussi", "s": 35.44, "e": 35.86}, {"w": " du", "s": 35.86, "e": 36.04}, {"w": " poulet", "s": 36.04, "e": 36.22}, {"w": " pané", "s": 36.22, "e": 36.56}, {"w": " frit,", "s": 36.56, "e": 36.82}, {"w": " très", "s": 36.9, "e": 37.06}, {"w": " bonne", "s": 37.06, "e": 37.28}, {"w": " chapeur,", "s": 37.28, "e": 37.86}, {"w": " ils", "s": 37.94, "e": 38.1}, {"w": " étaient", "s": 38.1, "e": 38.54}, {"w": " énormes.", "s": 38.54, "e": 39.16}]}, {"start": 39.28, "end": 42.26, "text": " Alors pour moi ce sera un 8, comme j'ai dit, grave bon, grave généreux, rien n'est parfait.